Entries for the Georgia QSO Party used by in-state stations
50 states including Georgia + DC + 13 Canadian provinces and territories (51 + 13).
The 159 Georgia counties count as Ga (georgia_cty.dom maps each county to Ga).
DX stations count for QSO points only: there is no DX multiplier.
The county file comes FIRST, so the S48.DOM line for Ga is read after it and the
multiplier keeps the name Georgia rather than the last county name.
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.
https://gaqsoparty.com

INCLUDE FILE georgia_cty.dom
INCLUDE FILE S50.DOM
INCLUDE FILE DC.DOM
INCLUDE FILE P13.DOM
